30	 * Best-effort, in the same way and for the same reason: nothing here fails the
31	 * run. An empty `branch` output means this run has no branch it may push to, it
32	 * stays on the detached checkout, and the tool that needs a branch refuses with a
33	 * message saying what the run cannot do. Stopping before the agent has said
34	 * anything would be worse than that.
